# Mulgore - Completionist (pack butler-routes-completionist, v1).
# The Horde block's Tauren starting-zone route: every Mulgore accept
# in the local census (72 quests, docs/mulgore-census.md) appears
# exactly once as an accept and once as a turnin. Band 1-13 by
# minLevel cluster (zone id 1412, order 47); 95350 Welcome to Azeroth
# (lvl13/min7) is the finale-rule IN. The Thunder Bluff city rule
# sends all 1456-accept quests to the future city census (150 duals
# including the Shaman/Druid city legs and the Hunter chain's city
# legs); Barrens-homed 775/833 and Durotar-homed 1505/1883 are noted
# where their chains cross but never double-contracted.
# No race header: every line gates exactly what the data gates -
# only Tauren on the Tauren-only rites and totem chains, only
# Warrior,Tauren / only Hunter,Tauren / only Shaman,Tauren / only
# Druid,Tauren on the four class notes, only Shaman on the Call of
# Earth/Fire links, only Druid,Tauren on 5928 (Barrens 6128
# precedent), only Druid,Horde on 94911 (Durotar 98517 precedent),
# only Priest,Troll on the Hex leg and only Priest,Undead on the
# Touch leg (Durotar's blocked-first twins live here as the Mulgore
# halves), only Hunter,Tauren on the taming chain. The camping pass
# rides optional + when-skill gated like Durotar's, with only the
# operative Kaga step functional. One soft-pre mini stands alone:
# when onquest 98424 (item-started, uncontracted) for 98427.
# Expedition legs switch frames deliberately and back: Orgrimmar
# (1454, Thrall takes 95350 home), the Barrens (1413, Kranal Fiss
# takes 2984), Durotar (1411, Ur'kyo takes 5655), Tirisfal (1420,
# Aelthalyste takes 5661).
guide butler-routes-completionist/mulgore
title Mulgore
levels 1-13
zone Mulgore
faction Horde
category Leveling
folder Completionist
coords live
version 1

step Camp Narache - arrival

  zone map 1412

  note Grull Hawkwind (44.47,77.5) runs the camp: Chief Hawkwind (43.89,76.66) and Greatmother Hawkwind (48.77,80.92) trade the humble tasks; the trainers Harutt (43.75,76.72), Lanka (43.96,76.35), Meela Dawnstrider (44.58,76.56) and Gart (44.65,76.55) take the class notes; Brave Windfeather (44.18,77.03) eyes Sharptusk far east; Antur Fallow (39.16,81.24) needs Innkeeper Kauth in Bloodhoof.

  accept 747 -- The Hunt Begins - Grull; plainstrider meat and feathers, the herds south
  complete 747 @42.8,77.05 era -- Plainstrider Meat and Feathers (Plainstriders, south herds)
  turnin 747 -- The Hunt Begins - the hunt to Grull
  accept 752 -- A Humble Task - Chief Hawkwind; Greatmother takes the word
  turnin 752 -- A Humble Task - the word to Greatmother Hawkwind
  accept 753 -- A Humble Task - Greatmother Hawkwind; the Water Pitcher at the well
  complete 753 @48.91,81.17 era -- Water Pitcher (the well east of camp)
  turnin 753 -- A Humble Task - the pitcher to Chief Hawkwind
  accept 750 -- The Hunt Continues - Grull; mountain cougar pelts, the ridges
  complete 750 @41.11,81.67 era -- Mountain Cougar Pelts (Mountain Cougars, the ridges)
  turnin 750 -- The Hunt Continues - the pelts to Grull
  accept 780 -- The Battleboars - Grull; snouts and flanks, the pens and flats
  complete 780 @51.31,78 era -- Battleboar Snouts and Flanks (Battleboars)
  turnin 780 -- The Battleboars - the boar work to Grull
  accept 3091 only Warrior,Tauren -- Simple Note - Grull; Harutt takes it
  turnin 3091 only Warrior,Tauren -- Simple Note - the note to Harutt Thunderhorn
  accept 3092 only Hunter,Tauren -- Etched Note - Grull; Lanka takes it
  turnin 3092 only Hunter,Tauren -- Etched Note - the note to Lanka Farshot
  accept 3093 only Shaman,Tauren -- Rune-Inscribed Note - Grull; Meela takes it
  turnin 3093 only Shaman,Tauren -- Rune-Inscribed Note - the note to Meela Dawnstrider
  accept 3094 only Druid,Tauren -- Verdant Note - Grull; Gart takes it
  turnin 3094 only Druid,Tauren -- Verdant Note - the note to Gart Mistrunner
  accept 3376 -- Break Sharptusk! - Windfeather; the chief far east (east leg below)
  complete 3376 @61.02,78 era -- Chief Sharptusk Thornmantle (southeast flats)
  accept 1656 -- A Task Unfinished - Antur Fallow; Innkeeper Kauth in Bloodhoof takes the word
