step Rites of the Earthmother - south and east

  zone map 1412

  note The Earthmother chain runs south first: Seer Graytongue (42.54,90.13) reads the rites, the quilboar belts come off Bristlebacks southeast (55.2,77.39), Zarlman Two-Moons (46.88,61.19) keeps the vision in Bloodhoof, and Seer Wiserunner (34.31,43.29) keeps the wisdom west, and the Ancestral Spirit waits east (58.31,30.7).

  accept 755 -- Rites of the Earthmother - Chief Hawkwind; Seer Graytongue takes the word
  turnin 755 -- Rites of the Earthmother - the word to Seer Graytongue
  accept 757 -- Rite of Strength - Graytongue; twelve Bristleback Belts, southeast
  complete 757 @55.76,78.56 era -- Bristleback Belts (Bristlebacks, southeast)
  turnin 757 -- Rite of Strength - the belts to Chief Hawkwind
  accept 763 -- Rites of the Earthmother - Chief Hawkwind; Baine takes the word
  turnin 763 -- Rites of the Earthmother - the word to Baine Bloodhoof
  accept 767 -- Rite of Vision - Baine; Zarlman takes the word
  turnin 767 -- Rite of Vision - the word to Zarlman Two-Moons
