  turnin 771 -- Rite of Vision - the vision to Zarlman Two-Moons
  accept 772 -- Rite of Vision - Zarlman; Seer Wiserunner west takes the word
  turnin 772 -- Rite of Vision - the word to Seer Wiserunner
  accept 773 -- Rite of Wisdom - Wiserunner; the Ancestral Spirit east takes it (Barrens-owned 775 follows - see census)
  turnin 773 -- Rite of Wisdom - the wisdom to the Ancestral Spirit

