  zone map 1412

  note Var'jun (46.2,62.27) holds the two Mulgore Hex/Touch legs: the Hex runs to Ur'kyo in Durotar, the Touch to Aelthalyste in Tirisfal (expedition legs below). Durotar routes the sibling legs. Gennia Runetotem (47.48,62.95) sends young druids to Turak north.

