  zone map 1412

  note Kaga Wildhoof (46.18,67.3) runs the camp: Chief Hawkwind's Adventurer word (96659) opens the pass and the campfire sitting completes the Outdoors (96605). The twelve profession legs are optional and skill-gated - they only credit with their pre chain done, so the route never wedges on them.

